                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "317c4f3e-e96c-3487-8d2e-2ac24ce6943e",
                        "entry_id": "dfa6b3ab-52e1-3b5c-848f-05e81d39fd26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "osoba zajmująca się konstrukcją modeli samolotów, statków itp.; odtwarzaniem rzeczywistych obiektów w postaci pomniejszonej"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4184c0e7-cf29-4752-b7d3-1de9fa3cd6a0",
                                "sense_id": "317c4f3e-e96c-3487-8d2e-2ac24ce6943e",
                                "text": "Od przedszkola zajmowałem się sklejaniem modeli samolotów i czytałem porady dla modelarzy."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2c2baa1-eac1-35a7-8a22-72aeab9d78cc",
                        "entry_id": "dfa6b3ab-52e1-3b5c-848f-05e81d39fd26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "specjalista projektujący i wykonujący modele (np. odlewy) do produkcji różnych wyrobów"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e888f0e0-04fb-48e3-8263-7c262cba0bf4",
                        "source_entry_id": "dfa6b3ab-52e1-3b5c-848f-05e81d39fd26",
                        "source_sense_id": "317c4f3e-e96c-3487-8d2e-2ac24ce6943e",
                        "target_lang_word": "modeller",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "modeller",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3985e6c-b141-3827-8191-2f912ba28b93",
                                        "entry_id": "b1ebd7ba-7475-3097-8866-27e2743e86d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of modeler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bf4fbea-ea22-4a20-8fdf-e376e7c7d064",
                                                "sense_id": "c3985e6c-b141-3827-8191-2f912ba28b93",
                                                "text": "... Or the proper fan might make a model of the Underground. Probably the leading Underground modeller is John Polley, who used to be a Tube train driver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db84140-a0f3-4f06-a4ef-8a7dd4d46c80",
                                                "sense_id": "c3985e6c-b141-3827-8191-2f912ba28b93",
                                                "text": "In an ingenious approach, a team of 11 scientists – including biologists, geneticists, glaciologists, computer scientists and ice-sheet modellers – looked at the genetics of Turquet’s octopus – a species that has been living around the Antarctic continent for about 4m years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99a542ab-2075-44b7-b25c-ab5a34fbff4f",
                        "source_entry_id": "dfa6b3ab-52e1-3b5c-848f-05e81d39fd26",
                        "source_sense_id": "317c4f3e-e96c-3487-8d2e-2ac24ce6943e",
                        "target_lang_word": "modelář",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3cad487e-48bb-4779-84b9-af69021a2d21",
                        "source_entry_id": "dfa6b3ab-52e1-3b5c-848f-05e81d39fd26",
                        "source_sense_id": "317c4f3e-e96c-3487-8d2e-2ac24ce6943e",
                        "target_lang_word": "modéliste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "modéliste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8acbd6dd-e7ec-3244-b705-96bcc75d7f99",
                                        "entry_id": "4fcd8705-9292-323b-bf4f-5fd0c42f05de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne chargée de créer le patron d’un vêtement (les formes des différentes pièces du vêtement)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18b69d89-8715-4803-aff9-ed334585c146",
                                                "sense_id": "8acbd6dd-e7ec-3244-b705-96bcc75d7f99",
                                                "text": "La modéliste réalise ensuite le patron de base en taille standard, à moins que ce travail ne soit confié à une patronnière ou à une patronnière-gradeuse. Le nouveau modèle peut alors être produit dans sa matière définitive et à l'unité (prototype) par la mécanicienne-modèle : celle-ci confectionne le vêtement en tenant compte des indications fournies par la modéliste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fa10789-ddd3-4b88-b235-d11619ffcebf",
                                                "sense_id": "8acbd6dd-e7ec-3244-b705-96bcc75d7f99",
                                                "text": "Notre fuyarde risque de se pointer à nouveau chez la modéliste."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2744134f-db6d-3387-aa01-de85db09be62",
                                        "entry_id": "4fcd8705-9292-323b-bf4f-5fd0c42f05de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne pratiquant le modélisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a399553a-bc31-4790-a22d-dca1db1edcec",
                                                "sense_id": "2744134f-db6d-3387-aa01-de85db09be62",
                                                "text": "Le Morop est la Fédération européenne des modélistes ferroviaires et amis des chemins de fer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
